531
00:35:52.545 --> 00:35:53.612
Oh, hold up.

532
00:35:54.647 --> 00:35:55.849
You see that?

533
00:35:56.950 --> 00:35:59.351
Holy shit.

534
00:35:59.353 --> 00:36:00.921
What the hell
happened to this thing?

535
00:36:04.523 --> 00:36:07.961
Looks like it imploded.
There's, uh, something.

536
00:36:10.364 --> 00:36:11.697
Something all over it.

537
00:36:12.698 --> 00:36:13.766
You seeing this?

538
00:36:16.269 --> 00:36:17.634
What is that?

539
00:36:17.636 --> 00:36:18.870
I would need to take
a closer look.

540
00:36:18.872 --> 00:36:20.905
It could be
some sort of an-an algae.

541
00:36:20.907 --> 00:36:22.508
You ever see
anything like that?

542
00:36:23.844 --> 00:36:25.676
This looks...

543
00:36:25.678 --> 00:36:27.080
It doesn't look
like algae.

544
00:36:28.547 --> 00:36:30.647
Is there anybody in it?

545
00:36:30.649 --> 00:36:31.617
Empty.

546
00:36:32.651 --> 00:36:33.819
I got something.

547
00:36:35.688 --> 00:36:36.655
Wallet.

548
00:36:39.259 --> 00:36:41.228
Great. We can use
his credit cards.

549
00:36:45.232 --> 00:36:46.797
All right, Captain,
there's no body,

550
00:36:46.799 --> 00:36:48.199
so can we please
and thank you

551
00:36:48.201 --> 00:36:50.003
get the hell out of here
before we...

552
00:36:52.205 --> 00:36:54.406
Scratch that. There's a body.
It's entangled...

553
00:36:54.408 --> 00:36:55.639
They should just come back.

554
00:36:55.641 --> 00:36:56.910
in the coils.

555
00:37:04.351 --> 00:37:06.151
Dude, don't check it out.
Just come back.

556
00:37:06.153 --> 00:37:07.584
- Just come back.
- Wait.

557
00:37:07.586 --> 00:37:08.821
Do you see his back?

558
00:37:13.527 --> 00:37:16.560
- Can you guys see that?
- Let's just bring them back.

559
00:37:16.562 --> 00:37:17.661
Okay, come back, guys.

560
00:37:17.663 --> 00:37:18.664
Paul.

561
00:37:20.200 --> 00:37:21.667
Whoa. Smith.

562
00:37:23.303 --> 00:37:24.237
Paul.

563
00:37:28.141 --> 00:37:30.043
The hell's going on
with his body?

564
00:37:32.711 --> 00:37:36.548
Did the pressure...
liquefy...

565
00:37:39.186 --> 00:37:40.753
Paul, hold
still! God!

566
00:37:45.892 --> 00:37:47.892
What is that thing?

567
00:37:47.894 --> 00:37:49.726
All I know is that it was
eating a dead body

568
00:37:49.728 --> 00:37:51.198
and then it came at me.

569
00:37:55.502 --> 00:37:57.402
Em, what are you doing?

570
00:37:57.404 --> 00:37:59.104
Uh, I'm just looking for its...

571
00:37:59.106 --> 00:38:00.771
Oh, no, no!

572
00:38:00.773 --> 00:38:02.440
See?

573
00:38:02.442 --> 00:38:03.877
Looking for its mouth.

574
00:38:07.780 --> 00:38:08.980
Is it still alive?

575
00:38:08.982 --> 00:38:10.849
- No, no, no.
- 'Cause I will kill it.

576
00:38:10.851 --> 00:38:12.450
I think I just touched a nerve.

577
00:38:12.452 --> 00:38:15.487
Norah, how much
further do we have?

578
00:38:15.489 --> 00:38:17.355
Two hundred meters
away from the bottom.

579
00:38:18.358 --> 00:38:19.756
It doesn't have any eyes.

580
00:38:19.758 --> 00:38:21.692
How are they attracted
to the light?

581
00:38:21.694 --> 00:38:22.961
Oh, my God, look at this.

582
00:38:22.963 --> 00:38:24.795
Maybe they're like moths.

583
00:38:24.797 --> 00:38:26.797
Underwater moths.

584
00:38:26.799 --> 00:38:28.900
It's like talons.

585
00:38:28.902 --> 00:38:30.869
I think this might be
a new species.

586
00:38:30.871 --> 00:38:32.504
Do we get to name it?

587
00:38:32.506 --> 00:38:34.072
I shot it. I'm naming it.

588
00:38:36.476 --> 00:38:39.146
I've never seen
sea life like this down here.

589
00:38:43.450 --> 00:38:47.285
Unless... Unless we bored
into a hydrothermal pocket.

590
00:38:47.287 --> 00:38:50.123
If it was sustained heat
that could support life...

591
00:38:50.957 --> 00:38:52.223
Are you serious?

592
00:38:52.225 --> 00:38:55.326
Everybody stay calm. Stay calm.

593
00:38:55.328 --> 00:38:57.295
- Oh, my God.
- Norah, what'd you get?

594
00:38:57.297 --> 00:38:58.729
Nothing.
It's not just the lights.

595
00:38:58.731 --> 00:39:00.532
The whole system's down.

596
00:39:00.534 --> 00:39:02.333
Can you put us in neutral?
Glide the rest of the way?

597
00:39:02.335 --> 00:39:03.170
Yeah.

598
00:39:07.374 --> 00:39:09.040
