607
00:40:10.270 --> 00:40:14.239
It's probably not a good time
to ask, but is that a baby?

608
00:40:25.619 --> 00:40:27.252
Should we close that door?

609
00:40:33.460 --> 00:40:36.496
I'm gonna close it.
I'm gonna close that door.

610
00:40:57.384 --> 00:40:58.251
Okay.

611
00:41:00.854 --> 00:41:02.720
We gotta find a way to get down.

612
00:41:02.722 --> 00:41:05.058
We're completely disengaged.
I don't know why we're not moving yet.

613
00:41:18.705 --> 00:41:20.938
Oh, my God!

614
00:41:20.940 --> 00:41:22.075
What the hell was that?

615
00:41:24.277 --> 00:41:26.044
- Oh, my God!
- The Kepler exploded!

616
00:41:26.046 --> 00:41:27.045
The Kepler!

617
00:41:27.047 --> 00:41:28.814
Oh, shit, shit, shit!

618
00:41:31.284 --> 00:41:32.218
Captain!

619
00:41:33.386 --> 00:41:34.852
Into the pressure chamber!

620
00:41:34.854 --> 00:41:35.889
Oh, God!

621
00:41:39.726 --> 00:41:41.125
We have to open
the outside hatch

622
00:41:41.127 --> 00:41:42.660
