in her own tears.

682
00:45:48.943 --> 00:45:51.142
Luckily, she could swim.

683
00:45:51.144 --> 00:45:52.878
It got pretty rough
for her after that.

684
00:45:57.617 --> 00:45:59.519
There's definitely
something following us.

685
00:46:03.489 --> 00:46:06.225
Okay. I'm getting very close
to shitting myself.

686
00:46:24.277 --> 00:46:26.845
Looks like somebody got
a care package.

687
00:46:26.847 --> 00:46:28.448
Cheetos and...

688
00:46:29.349 --> 00:46:30.650
Oh, the irony.

689
00:46:34.187 --> 00:46:35.622
I love MoonPies.

690
00:46:40.995 --> 00:46:42.495
This is someone's stuff.

691
00:46:47.166 --> 00:46:48.699
This is all someone's...

692
00:46:48.701 --> 00:46:49.569
Oh...

693
00:46:51.237 --> 00:46:52.303
Oh...

694
00:46:52.305 --> 00:46:53.406
Oh, my God.

695
00:47:12.158 --> 00:47:14.260
Keep moving. Keep moving.

696
00:47:15.294 --> 00:47:17.728
Yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah.

697
00:47:17.730 --> 00:47:20.065
Come on, guys,
we're almost there.

698
00:47:20.067 --> 00:47:21.467
It should be 300 meters ahead.

699
00:47:37.283 --> 00:47:38.917
Is this it?

700
00:47:38.919 --> 00:47:40.351
We can't go back.

701
00:47:40.353 --> 00:47:41.487
What does that mean?

702
00:47:42.288 --> 00:47:43.456
It's too tight.

703
00:47:44.257 --> 00:47:45.723
Oh, no.

704
00:47:45.725 --> 00:47:47.458
We've got to find
another way.

705
00:47:47.460 --> 00:47:49.228
I'm the smallest. Let me check.

706
00:47:50.130 --> 00:47:50.964
Here.

707
00:47:52.331 --> 00:47:53.999
Okay.

708
00:47:54.001 --> 00:47:55.501
Let me connect you with my line.

709
00:47:56.769 --> 00:47:57.637
Attached.

710
00:48:01.674 --> 00:48:02.508
Thank you.

711
00:48:31.571 --> 00:48:34.005
All right, I'm through.
It's open out here.

712
00:48:34.007 --> 00:48:35.606
And I think you guys
can definitely make it.

713
00:48:35.608 --> 00:48:36.975
It's really tight but...

714
00:48:36.977 --> 00:48:38.542
- Okay.
- Huh?

715
00:48:38.544 --> 00:48:39.443
We're sending Emily.

716
00:48:39.445 --> 00:48:40.480
Yeah, okay.

717
00:48:41.247 --> 00:48:42.381
Attached.

718
00:48:54.527 --> 00:48:55.359
Captain's
on his way.

719
00:48:55.361 --> 00:48:56.395
Hey, come here.

720
00:48:59.099 --> 00:48:59.933
Nice.

721
00:49:07.007 --> 00:49:08.206
Hey.

722
00:49:08.208 --> 00:49:09.774
How you holding up?

723
00:49:09.776 --> 00:49:10.610
I'm okay.

724
00:49:12.079 --> 00:49:14.012
Um, I was gonna eat this,

725
00:49:14.014 --> 00:49:15.981
but Lil Paul and I decided

726
00:49:15.983 --> 00:49:17.683
that you should
give it to your girl.

727
00:49:18.684 --> 00:49:19.987
- MoonPie.
- Yeah.

728
00:49:20.921 --> 00:49:21.989
MoonPie.

729
00:49:23.523 --> 00:49:24.890
Thanks, man.

730
00:49:24.892 --> 00:49:26.824
She's pretty cool.

731
00:49:26.827 --> 00:49:28.896
Gotta make sure
not to screw that up.

732
00:49:30.998 --> 00:49:31.832
Yeah.

733
00:49:38.839 --> 00:49:40.138
Smith.

734
00:49:40.140 --> 00:49:41.372
Your turn. Come on.

735
00:49:41.374 --> 00:49:43.409
All right, Cap's through.
I'm going.

736
00:49:46.813 --> 00:49:48.916
All right, guys.
I'm coming through.

737
00:49:55.721 --> 00:49:57.721
How are you doing in there, buddy?

738
00:49:57.723 --> 00:49:59.092
You want your bunny heater?

739
00:50:08.634 --> 00:50:10.536
All right, forget this.
We're going in.

740
00:50:13.140 --> 00:50:14.338
Hey. You okay?

741
00:50:14.340 --> 00:50:15.541
- Paul, can you hear me?
- Yeah.

742
00:50:16.509 --> 00:50:17.743
- You okay?
- Yeah.

743
00:50:20.047 --> 00:50:21.345
- What is that?
- Huh?

744
00:50:21.347 --> 00:50:22.914
Paul?
Paul, are you reading?

745
00:50:22.916 --> 00:50:24.715
Don't screw around. Let's go.

746
00:50:24.717 --> 00:50:26.517
Hey, Paul, you copy?

747
00:50:26.519 --> 00:50:28.385
We're gonna pull you through.

748
00:50:28.387 --> 00:50:29.820
- All right, pull.
- All right.

749
00:50:29.822 --> 00:50:30.656
Here we go.

750
00:50:40.433 --> 00:50:42.501
- Come on.
- I'm pulling. I'm pulling.

751
00:50:43.270 --> 00:50:44.435
Come on.

752
00:50:44.437 --> 00:50:45.538
Shit!

753
00:50:47.040 --> 00:50:48.041
Come on, come on.

754
00:50:52.612 --> 00:50:54.045
There he is.

755
00:50:54.047 --> 00:50:56.014
You scared the shit out of me.

756
00:50:56.016 --> 00:50:58.616
There's something back there.
Some Slender Man-type shit.

757
00:50:58.618 --> 00:50:59.717
Hey, that's not funny.

758
00:51:01.754 --> 00:51:02.956
