759
00:51:06.592 --> 00:51:07.826
Smith, unclip.
He's all tangled up.

760
00:51:07.828 --> 00:51:08.794
- Okay, I got it.
- Oh, no!

761
00:51:11.098 --> 00:51:12.065
Unclip, unclip, unclip!

762
00:51:13.466 --> 00:51:14.565
Take Lil Paul! Take Lil Paul!

763
00:51:14.567 --> 00:51:15.666
Give me my helmet!

764
00:51:15.668 --> 00:51:17.468
It's pulling me underwater!

765
00:51:17.470 --> 00:51:18.702
He's going! Helmet!

766
00:51:18.704 --> 00:51:19.503
- My helmet!
- Helmet, now!

767
00:51:19.505 --> 00:51:20.773
Get it on! Get it on!

768
00:51:21.707 --> 00:51:22.742
Grab him! Grab him!

769
00:51:31.184 --> 00:51:32.451
Grab him! Grab him!

770
00:51:37.057 --> 00:51:38.524
I can't hold him!

771
00:51:42.930 --> 00:51:44.129
Oh, my God!

772
00:51:45.464 --> 00:51:46.532
Oh, my God!

773
00:51:47.234 --> 00:51:48.467
Paul!

774
00:51:52.705 --> 00:51:54.172
Get out of the water!

775
00:51:54.174 --> 00:51:55.741
- Emily, go!
- Get to the bulkhead!

776
00:52:11.557 --> 00:52:16.094
Calling CQ. Calling CQ.
This is Captain Lucien.

777
00:52:16.096 --> 00:52:19.132
We're at the Midway Station.
It's heavily damaged.

778
00:52:21.201 --> 00:52:22.936
Not sure how long it will last.

779
00:52:25.238 --> 00:52:26.572
Does anyone copy?

780
00:52:28.541 --> 00:52:29.977
It ripped him out of the suit.

781
00:52:31.577 --> 00:52:33.713
It ripped him right out
of his goddamn suit.

782
00:52:35.215 --> 00:52:36.214
What could do that?

783
00:52:36.216 --> 00:52:37.715
Begin evacuation

784
00:52:37.717 --> 00:52:39.284
