785
00:52:39.286 --> 00:52:40.653
CQ, do you copy?

786
00:52:42.422 --> 00:52:44.490
Overwatch
tower is online.

787
00:52:45.325 --> 00:52:46.592
What is happening?

788
00:52:51.965 --> 00:52:54.001
That drill weighs 6,000 tons.

789
00:52:56.003 --> 00:52:57.803
How did it get
ripped up like that?

790
00:53:00.307 --> 00:53:01.507
We did this.

791
00:53:04.444 --> 00:53:06.213
We drilled
the bottom of the ocean.

792
00:53:07.646 --> 00:53:09.149
We took too much.

793
00:53:10.450 --> 00:53:12.518
