01:22:24.704 --> 01:22:26.539
All right, come on,
this way. This way.

1068
01:22:27.941 --> 01:22:30.242
Bulkheads
closed.

1069
01:22:30.244 --> 01:22:31.843
Flooding contained.

1070
01:22:31.845 --> 01:22:33.444
...future
of Titan Industries...

1071
01:22:33.446 --> 01:22:34.948
Oh, no! No, no, no!

1072
01:22:37.151 --> 01:22:39.683
Command
bridge compromised.

1073
01:22:39.685 --> 01:22:42.586
- This way! Come on!
- Flooding contained.

1074
01:22:42.588 --> 01:22:44.421
Welcome
aboard the Roebuck.

1075
01:22:44.423 --> 01:22:46.894
Tian Industries'
titan-class drill.

1076
01:22:48.294 --> 01:22:49.562
Go, go, go!

1077
01:22:58.571 --> 01:23:00.671
Deck
F compromised.

1078
01:23:00.673 --> 01:23:02.540
Bulkheads closed.

1079
01:23:02.542 --> 01:23:04.475
Flooding contained.

1080
01:23:04.477 --> 01:23:06.677
Come on.

1081
01:23:06.679 --> 01:23:09.247
Please find your way
to the nearest pod deck

1082
01:23:09.249 --> 01:23:10.750
for immediate evacuation.

1083
01:23:11.885 --> 01:23:12.750
Yes! Yes!

1084
01:23:12.752 --> 01:23:14.518
Begin evacuation

1085
01:23:14.520 --> 01:23:16.188
to surface immediately.

1086
01:23:16.190 --> 01:23:17.490
Yes! Yes!

1087
01:23:28.734 --> 01:23:32.840
Warning. Warning.
Pod non-operational.

1088
01:23:34.674 --> 01:23:35.808
Are we set, Norah?

1089
01:23:37.978 --> 01:23:39.980
Pod non-operational.

1090
01:23:42.216 --> 01:23:43.949
Yeah.

1091
01:23:43.951 --> 01:23:45.616
Yeah, we're good.

1092
01:23:45.618 --> 01:23:47.319
- Do we have enough pods?
- Yep.

1093
01:23:47.321 --> 01:23:48.485
Are you sure?
How many do we have?

1094
01:23:48.487 --> 01:23:49.386
We got three,
we got three.

1095
01:23:49.388 --> 01:23:50.922
- Three?
- Yep.

1096
01:23:50.924 --> 01:23:52.489
- Okay, you go, you go. You guys go.
- No way.

1097
01:23:52.491 --> 01:23:53.859
No, you go first. I'll go last.

1098
01:23:53.861 --> 01:23:55.160
- I'll go last.
- Hey. Come on.

1099
01:23:55.162 --> 01:23:55.996
Hey. Watch your head.

1100
01:23:57.396 --> 01:24:00.065
Deck F
compromised.

1101
01:24:00.067 --> 01:24:01.667
You have to make it, okay?

1102
01:24:02.602 --> 01:24:04.102
You promise me?

1103
01:24:04.104 --> 01:24:05.536
I promise.

1104
01:24:05.538 --> 01:24:08.006
Flooding
contained.

1105
01:24:08.008 --> 01:24:11.076
Hey, thanks for dragging me
across the bottom of the ocean.

1106
01:24:11.078 --> 01:24:12.710
Any time.

1107
01:24:12.712 --> 01:24:15.046
Except never,
never again, please.

1108
01:24:15.048 --> 01:24:16.114
Fair enough.

1109
01:24:16.116 --> 01:24:18.151
Pod launch
sequence activated.

1110
01:24:19.385 --> 01:24:21.652
I'll see you soon. Okay.

1111
01:24:21.654 --> 01:24:23.355
Here. You gotta take this.

1112
01:24:23.357 --> 01:24:24.925
Give it to his folks
or something.

1113
01:24:26.492 --> 01:24:29.760
Shit. Lil Paul.

1114
01:24:29.762 --> 01:24:31.595
Let 'em know he was my favorite
pain in the ass, okay?

1115
01:24:31.597 --> 01:24:33.066
- Will do.
- Bye, bud.

1116
01:24:37.803 --> 01:24:41.772
Begin evacuation
to surface immediately.

1117
01:24:48.748 --> 01:24:51.448
Come on, you're up.

1118
01:24:51.450 --> 01:24:54.152
No, I can take the last one.
It's fine, it's fine. Seriously, you go.

1119
01:24:54.154 --> 01:24:55.552
No. Come on, get in.

1120
01:24:55.554 --> 01:24:56.955
No, seriously.

1121
01:24:56.957 --> 01:24:59.024
You can't even operate
this thing. Let's go.

1122
01:25:00.294 --> 01:25:01.427
What's wrong with it?

1123
01:25:02.628 --> 01:25:04.628
Get in the pod.

1124
01:25:04.630 --> 01:25:06.131
Emily, I can fix it.
We don't have time for this.

1125
01:25:06.133 --> 01:25:07.665
- Oh, my God, no. I'm not leaving you.
- Come on.

1126
01:25:07.667 --> 01:25:09.067
No. You're not leaving him.

1127
01:25:09.069 --> 01:25:11.236
Deck B compromised.

1128
01:25:11.238 --> 01:25:12.770
If you stay here,
you're gonna die here.

1129
01:25:12.772 --> 01:25:14.372
And then what are we even doing?

1130
01:25:14.374 --> 01:25:16.207
I will stay with you and we
can fix it together, okay?

1131
01:25:16.209 --> 01:25:18.410
We don't have time for that.
Come on, get in the pod.

1132
01:25:18.412 --> 01:25:20.678
Hey! What are you... Norah.

1133
01:25:20.680 --> 01:25:22.247
Do you know what I would do
for one more second?

1134
01:25:22.249 --> 01:25:23.714
Just one more second with Sam?

1135
01:25:23.716 --> 01:25:25.850
Anything. Anything.

1136
01:25:25.852 --> 01:25:27.185
Go. You have a whole life.

1137
01:25:27.187 --> 01:25:28.552
- No, no. Norah, stop it.
- Emily. Emily.

1138
01:25:28.554 --> 01:25:29.622
Stop it!

1139
01:25:31.391 --> 01:25:32.692
Sorry. Sorry.

1140
01:25:34.460 --> 01:25:36.627
There we go.

1141
01:25:36.629 --> 01:25:39.463
Pod launch
sequence activated.

1142
01:25:39.465 --> 01:25:41.034
You better make it
up there, okay?

1143
01:25:42.235 --> 01:25:43.536
It's gonna be all right.

1144
01:25:44.570 --> 01:25:46.071
Okay?

1145
01:25:46.073 --> 01:25:48.273
Deck B compromised.

1146
01:25:48.275 --> 01:25:49.876
Bulkheads closed.

1147
01:26:09.963 --> 01:26:12.629
Please find your way
to the nearest pod deck

1148
01:26:12.631 --> 01:26:14.633
for immediate evacuation.

1149
01:26:18.005 --> 01:26:21.373
Begin evacuation
to surface immediately.

1150
01:26:23.743 --> 01:26:26.111
Deck A compromised.

1151
01:26:26.113 --> 01:26:30.348
Bulkheads closed.
Flooding contained.

1152
01:26:43.363 --> 01:26:46.264
Please find your way
to the nearest pod deck

1153
01:26:46.266 --> 01:26:48.068
for immediate evacuation.

1154
01:26:51.804 --> 01:26:55.242
Begin evacuation
to surface immediately.

1155
01:27:10.123 --> 01:27:12.125
Pressure anomalies
detected.

1156
01:27:27.174 --> 01:27:28.339
There are things
that will happen

1157
01:27:28.341 --> 01:27:31.109
that will make you feel
powerless...

1158
01:27:31.111 --> 01:27:33.046
and make you feel
insignificant.

1159
01:27:35.215 --> 01:27:36.016
But that's it.

1160
01:27:37.750 --> 01:27:38.818
They're just feelings.

1161
01:27:40.520 --> 01:27:43.990
Begin evacuation
to surface immediately.

1162
01:27:45.859 --> 01:27:48.259
And sometimes
you have to stop feeling.

1163
01:27:48.261 --> 01:27:49.327
Start doing.

1164
01:27:49.329 --> 01:27:53.465
Foreign objects
approaching pods.

1165
01:27:53.467 --> 01:27:57.102
Foreign objects
approaching pods.

1166
01:27:57.104 --> 01:28:00.307
NDistance to contact, 60 meters.

1167
01:28:06.046 --> 01:28:08.647
Accessing core terminal.

1168
01:28:20.961 --> 01:28:22.329
You know
what we're sitting on?

1169
01:28:25.232 --> 01:28:26.763
A lot of energy.

1170
01:28:26.765 --> 01:28:28.034
With nowhere to go.

1171
01:28:45.552 --> 01:28:48.088
Core
meltdown in progress.

1172
01:28:51.358 --> 01:28:53.160
One minute until
meltdown.

1173
01:28:54.261 --> 01:28:55.661
You got 60 seconds.

1174
01:29:04.571 --> 01:29:06.772
You lose your sense of time
in the dark.

1175
01:29:09.009 --> 01:29:13.978
Four, three, two, one.

1176
01:29:13.980 --> 01:29:15.248
So let's
light this shit up.

1177
01:32:22.104 --> 01:32:27.104
CBR900RR
